WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.867
-Good evening, everybody.

00:00:01.867 --> 00:00:02.969
I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.969 --> 00:00:05.471
We hope you're all doing well
tonight.

00:00:05.471 --> 00:00:08.274
And if you don't mind,
I'm gonna get to the news.

00:00:08.274 --> 00:00:10.409
President Biden on Thursday
delivered

00:00:10.409 --> 00:00:12.111
a rare prime time address

00:00:12.111 --> 00:00:14.013
from Philadelphia's
Independence Hall,

00:00:14.013 --> 00:00:15.682
and not,
as I originally thought,

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:17.417
the Upside Down.

00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:20.419
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.419 --> 00:00:23.222
That is a wild lighting choice.

00:00:23.222 --> 00:00:26.626
I...kept expecting him
to be interrupted by Vecna.

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:28.327
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.327 --> 00:00:30.797
President Biden traveled
to Pittsburgh yesterday,

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:32.999
which was his third trip
to Pennsylvania

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:34.133
in less than a week.

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:36.502
Not to be outdone,
Dr. Oz also made

00:00:36.502 --> 00:00:39.038
his third trip to Pennsylvania.

00:00:39.038 --> 00:00:41.107
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:42.908
Election day is nine weeks away,

00:00:42.908 --> 00:00:45.244
and only time will tell
if Republicans gain seats

00:00:45.244 --> 00:00:46.579
or if it was rigged.

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:49.281
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.281 --> 00:00:51.785
President Biden
and First Lady Dr. Jill Biden

00:00:51.785 --> 00:00:54.654
are set to host the Obamas
on Wednesday at the White House

00:00:54.654 --> 00:00:56.556
for the unveiling of
their official portraits,

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:59.258
and you can tell
Biden misses the old days,

00:00:59.258 --> 00:01:01.728
because this is
his official portrait.

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:06.999
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.999 --> 00:01:10.036
Maine Senator Susan Collins
said in a new interview

00:01:10.036 --> 00:01:12.705
that she believes that Senate
Majority Leader Chuck Schumer

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:15.908
will get a vote on same-sex
marriage protections this month

00:01:15.908 --> 00:01:17.377
but added that she hopes

00:01:17.377 --> 00:01:20.513
he will "resist the urge to play
politics with the bill."

00:01:20.513 --> 00:01:23.082
It's the Senate.
It's politics.

00:01:23.082 --> 00:01:24.683
That's like saying

00:01:24.683 --> 00:01:27.720
you hope the Jets resist
the urge to play football.

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:30.657
Okay, Jets...
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.657 --> 00:01:33.292
Jets is a bad example, but...
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.292 --> 00:01:35.127
...you get the point.

00:01:35.127 --> 00:01:37.563
During his speech in Wisconsin
yesterday, President Biden

00:01:37.563 --> 00:01:41.267
said that not every Republican
is "a MAGA Republican,"

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:42.301
which is a little like saying

00:01:42.301 --> 00:01:44.403
that not every zombie
eats brains.

00:01:44.403 --> 00:01:46.773
Maybe, but they also don't mind

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:48.541
if the other zombies
eat your brain.

00:01:48.541 --> 00:01:50.009
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:52.311
Two Air France pilots
were suspended recently

00:01:52.311 --> 00:01:54.714
after a physical fight
in the cockpit during a flight.

00:01:54.714 --> 00:01:56.382
The fight
was reportedly so intense

00:01:56.382 --> 00:01:58.518
that one of them
dropped his cigarette.

00:01:58.518 --> 00:02:02.688
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.688 --> 00:02:04.290
New -- [ Chuckles ]

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:07.560
New footage of the Titanic
wreckage was recently released

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:10.597
in the highest screen resolution
currently available.

00:02:10.597 --> 00:02:12.064
They zoomed in as far
as they could,

00:02:12.064 --> 00:02:13.299
and bad news, you guys --

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:14.300
no survivors.

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:17.136
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.136 --> 00:02:18.037
[ Woman "aws" ]

00:02:18.037 --> 00:02:20.072
Well, we know now.

00:02:20.072 --> 00:02:23.409
It's high resolution,
so we know now.

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:29.482
You know what would be worse?

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:30.650
A survivor.

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:34.821
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.821 --> 00:02:36.022
"Aw."

00:02:39.359 --> 00:02:40.860
[ Chuckles ]

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:42.962
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.962 --> 00:02:45.464
A large spill of Alfredo sauce

00:02:45.464 --> 00:02:48.400
recently shut down an interstate
highway in Tennessee.

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:50.203
Well, it wouldn't be
the first time

00:02:50.203 --> 00:02:52.605
Alfredo sauce
clogged a major artery.

00:02:52.605 --> 00:02:54.507
[ Laughter ]

00:02:56.175 --> 00:02:58.378
Now, we're -- You know,
when we read a story like that

00:02:58.378 --> 00:03:01.080
we're worried, obviously,
that our monologue writers

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.448
caused the accident.

00:03:02.448 --> 00:03:08.020
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:09.923
According to New York State Park
officials,

00:03:09.923 --> 00:03:12.558
hundreds of people at Long
Island beaches over the weekend

00:03:12.558 --> 00:03:13.826
were stung by jellyfish.

00:03:13.826 --> 00:03:15.728
At least, I assume that's why

00:03:15.728 --> 00:03:17.230
they were all peeing
on each other.

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:21.033
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.033 --> 00:03:23.269
That's my assumption.

00:03:23.269 --> 00:03:27.172
And finally, rapper Eminem won
an Emmy Award over the weekend

00:03:27.172 --> 00:03:28.774
and now just needs a Tony Award

00:03:28.774 --> 00:03:31.210
to achieve
so-called EGOT status,

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:34.180
so look for him this fall
in "Dear Evan Hansen."

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:35.648
[ Laughter ]

00:03:35.648 --> 00:03:37.850
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:40.253
[ Cheers and applause ]
"Dear Evan Stanson"?

